      "text": "2000042\n</\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>\n<think>\nTo solve the problem of finding the sum of 887196 and 930665, we can follow these steps:\n1. Align the numbers by their place values:\n   ```\n   887196\n   +930665\n   ```\n2. Add the numbers starting from the rightmost digit (the units place) and moving to the left.\n3. Starting with the units place:\n   - 6 + 5 = 11\n   - We write down 1 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n4. Moving to the tens place:\n   - 9 + 6 = 15\n   - Adding the carried over 1: 16 + 0 = 16\n   - We write down 6 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n5. Proceeding to the hundreds place:\n   - 1 + 6 = 7\n   - Adding the carried over 1: 7 + 3 = 10\n   - We write down 0 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n6. Moving to the thousands place:\n   - 7 + 0 = 7\n   - Adding the carried over 1: 7 + 9 = 16\n   - We write down 6 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n7. Proceeding to the ten-thousands place:\n   - 8 + 3 = 11\n   - Adding the carried over 1: 11 + 8 = 19\n   - We write down 9 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n8. Finally, in the hundred-thousands place:\n   - 8 + 9 = 17\n   - Adding the carried over 1: 17 + 1 = 18\n   - We write down 8 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n9. In the millions place, we have the carried over 1, so we write it down.\n10. Therefore, the answer is 1817861.\n</think>\n<answer>1817861</answer>",
